A2 PSK network (tested on my t8122, testing on other devices appreciated).\r\n\r\nNo new `dt-check-style --mode strict` regressions (as i know jannau is [working on that](https://lore.kernel.org/asahi/20260914-apple-dts-m3-dt-style-check-v2-0-e3e89c33f562@jannau.net)).\r\n\r\nI've tried my best to keep the attribution right (and put all the needed CdB/SoB), even where I changed things a bit. But if something's missing / not right please LMK\r\n\r\nThinking 2 separate series when sending upstream:\r\n- introduce BCM4388 + its firmware (01-13)\r\n- Apple platform support (14-22)\r\n- 23 is [already submitted by jannau](https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260912-brcmfmac-4way-handshake-offload-authenticated-event-v1-1-e41a6a8281a2@jannau.net/) but included so people can test the branch (will not be included in upstream submission)\r\n\r\n(if the first series is too big, could also split into 01-04 and 04-14 but I think that'd make a chicken-and-egg problem)","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-20T02:55:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T11:41:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4b7a8dcd1670218dce0805d98414626e7a8de788","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"IntegralPilot:wifi","ref":"wifi","repo":{"id":1377780750,"node_id":"R_kgDOUh9EDg","name":"linux","full_name":"IntegralPilot/linux","owner":{"login":"IntegralPilot","id":109999292,"node_id":"U_kgDOBo50vA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109999292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntegralPilot","html_url":"https://github.com/IntegralPilot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntegralPilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntegralPilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntegralPilot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntegralPilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"h